    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. i'm looking at the raw engagement numbers for the 18-24 bracket right now and they look pretty underwhelming compared to the other groups. it's actually looking kind of flat. are you sure we should highlight the Gen Z reach in a board deck if that specific segment didn't really take off?",
